# UI Copy Professional Tone

- User-facing copy must be concise, neutral, and production-ready.
- Do not use demo/prototype wording in UI text.
- Remove feature-internal labels unless they provide clear user value.

## Disallowed patterns (examples)

- "润色你的草稿"
- "精简版"
- "短一些"
- "保留语气"
- Any wording that reads like an internal demo tag or generation label.

## Required style

- Prefer direct action labels and plain language.
- Keep labels short and unambiguous.
- If unsure, choose the more formal and less "AI showcase" wording.
